<%#
# Key: subagents/feedback/terminal_identity
# Purpose: Terminal subagent identity feedback.
# Used: Returned to the model when LittleGhost produces terminal subagent identity feedback.
# Locals:
# - id: Program or subagent identifier referenced by the message.
# - status: Current terminal subagent status.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
-%>
Subagent <%= id.inspect %> is <%= status %>; spawn a new identity.
